  "triggers": [
    {
      "id": "ravine_enter",
      "event": "room_entered",
      "actions": [
        { "type": "showMessage", "text": "Bioluminescent moss clings to the ravine walls in spreading patches of soft blue-green light. The 'lights' Tannis saw — not artificial. Alive." }
      ],
      "once": true
    },
    {
      "id": "biological_samples_first",
      "event": "item_picked_up",
      "filter": { "itemType": "biological_samples" },
      "conditions": [
        { "not": { "hasFlag": "collected_bio_samples" } }
      ],
      "actions": [
        { "type": "setFlag", "flag": "collected_bio_samples" },
        { "type": "showMessage", "lines": [
          "You carefully collect specimens of the ravine lichen — organisms that glow without any light source, thriving in total darkness.",
          "These are exactly what Councillor Asha Denn needs for her research. The specimens seem healthy, but they should be preserved properly.",
          "Dr. Vasik at Outpost Balor might be able to help with that."
        ]}
      ],
      "once": true
    },
    {
      "id": "ravine_lurker_warning",
      "event": "room_entered",
      "actions": [
        { "type": "showMessage", "text": "Heavy scraping sounds echo from the ravine walls. Something large moves in the depths — armored, deliberate. The Ravine Lurkers." }
      ],
      "once": true
    },
    {
      "id": "sable_message",
      "event": "room_entered",
      "conditions": [
        { "hasFlag": "helped_sable" }
      ],
      "actions": [
        { "type": "showMessage", "lines": [
          "At the bottom of the ravine, you find a flat area with Unbounded markings scratched into the rock. A small shelter — someone has been here recently.",
          "Fresh supplies. A banked fire, still warm. And scratched into the wall beside it, in Sable's distinctive angular script:",
          "\"I've been watching. You're close to something. Be careful — and be kind to what you find.\""
        ]}
      ],
      "once": true
    },
    {
      "id": "lurker_hide_drop",
      "event": "monster_killed",
      "filter": { "monsterType": "ravine_lurker" },
      "actions": [
        { "type": "showMessage", "text": "The Ravine Lurker collapses. Its thick, armored hide would make excellent crafting material." },
        { "type": "giveItem", "itemType": "lurker_hide" }
      ],
      "once": true
    },
    {
      "id": "track_fungal_kills",
      "event": "monster_killed",
      "filter": { "monsterType": "mycelium_lurker" },
      "conditions": [
        { "not": { "hasFlag": "ravine_mycelium_lurker_killed" } }
      ],
      "actions": [
        { "type": "setFlag", "flag": "ravine_mycelium_lurker_killed", "scope": "player" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "bioframe_manifest",
      "event": "monster_killed",
      "filter": { "monsterType": "mycelium_lurker" },
      "conditions": [
        { "hasFlag": "collected_bio_samples" },
        { "not": { "hasFlag": "bioframe_revealed" } }
      ],
      "actions": [
        { "type": "setFlag", "flag": "bioframe_revealed", "scope": "player" },
        { "type": "showMessage", "lines": [
          "As the Mycelium Lurker dies, something changes in the ravine. The bioluminescent moss flares bright — brighter than you've ever seen.",
          "The fungal network beneath your feet pulses in response. Tendrils of mycelium rise from the rock, weaving together with purpose. Not random growth — deliberate construction.",
          "They form around something buried in the ravine wall. Greenway bio-tech, integrated with the living network itself. A Sol Unit frame unlike anything manufactured — grown, not built.",
          "The Greenway Bioframe. The fungal network has decided you're worthy."
        ]},
        { "type": "spawnItem", "itemType": "greenway_bioframe", "x": 12, "y": 9 },
        { "type": "grantXp", "amount": 60 }
      ],
      "once": true
    },
    {
      "id": "bioframe_pickup",
      "event": "item_picked_up",
      "filter": { "itemType": "greenway_bioframe" },
      "actions": [
        { "type": "setFlag", "flag": "has_greenway_bioframe", "scope": "player" },
        { "type": "showMessage", "lines": [
          "The Bioframe is warm and slightly yielding — living tissue woven through its circuitry. You can feel it adapting to your grip.",
          "7x7 grid with symbiotic healing. Every strike feeds the bio-tech, and it feeds you back. Poison resistance built into its biology."
        ]}
      ],
      "once": true
    }
  ]
}
